> User Hkn526 (285331)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":80,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1907696,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285228,"Name":"Vjohana","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285228.jpg?_r=1447965003","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1447944747,"LastPoster":{"Id":285390,"Name":"maitte","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1907696,"PostDate":1447944747,"PostContent":"Hi Everyone, \u00a0 I am a newbie and I am completely overwhelmed during my search for a resort. I do...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vrichani@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.208.70.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446516797,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285228.jpg?_r=1447965003","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vjohana","Id":285228,"Name":"Vjohana","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.242.17.69","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79751,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fda665e3a80c46992934f22e20412fcb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am a newbie and I am completely overwhelmed during my search for a resort. I do not know where to begin! Right now I am looking at getting married either in May or August 2016 with approximately &amp;nbsp;35-50 guests. &amp;nbsp;I am looking at places in Mexico (still trying to decide where).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;While looking at wedding packages online, I wanted to know what are some additional costs that you can expect?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I always thought that packages included everything you need (I REALLY WISH!) but I am slowly beginning to notice that some really important items are missing from packages such as photography, videography, DJ, and reception! For those experienced brides, how much did you incur in additional expenses?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is worth working with a complimentary wedding package and then working to upgrade or input extra costs towards all the extras?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907696,"PostDate":1447944747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am a newbie and I am completely overwhelmed during my search for a resort. I do not know where to begin! Right now I am looking at getting married either in May or August 2016 with approximately \u00a035-50 guests. \u00a0I am looking at places in Mexico (still trying to decide where).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>While looking at wedding packages online, I wanted to know what are some additional costs that you can expect?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I always thought that packages included everything you need (I REALLY WISH!) but I am slowly beginning to notice that some really important items are missing from packages such as photography, videography, DJ, and reception! For those experienced brides, how much did you incur in additional expenses?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is worth working with a complimentary wedding package and then working to upgrade or input extra costs towards all the extras?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vrichani@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.208.70.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446516797,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285228.jpg?_r=1447965003","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vjohana","Id":285228,"Name":"Vjohana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79751,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7c6a438636d3ff603b0aa3d64803e7d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement!! You are right, there are lots of additional costs, which is annoying and they add up fast.   Most of the wedding packages are for the wedding ceremony only.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve had to budget for hair and makeup, photographer, DJ, private dinner and reception.&amp;nbsp; Any extra decorations will be extra, but I&#039;m not very creative, and I think Mexico is a place that won&#039;t require a ton of decorations. The back drop (ocean, sand, etc) is enough for me :)\n\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907709,"PostDate":1447956144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement!! You are right, there are lots of additional costs, which is annoying and they add up fast.\u00a0\u00a0 Most of the wedding packages are for the wedding ceremony only.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've had to budget for hair and makeup, photographer, DJ, private dinner and reception.\u00a0 Any extra decorations will be extra, but I'm not very creative, and I think Mexico is a place that won't require a ton of decorations. The back drop (ocean, sand, etc) is enough for me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424114250,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.80.195.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79751,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d9e44b80652f4fd6900a1ec96c50aa8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Vjohana and Congrats on your destination wedding coming up next year!!! You&#039;ve come to the right place to find loads of answers to your planning questions and help from all the resources you find here - so well done on getting a great start!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and that you enjoy your wonderful journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....to inspire you along your way, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured in our incomparable Mayan Riviera.....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/12248012_10153740893219487_2804814526822408303_o.jpg\" alt=\"12248012_10153740893219487_2804814526822\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/12109790_10153682859529487_4869403078968401747_o.jpg\" alt=\"12109790_10153682859529487_4869403078968\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11951533_10153610355409487_3502002007315431031_o.jpg\" alt=\"11951533_10153610355409487_3502002007315\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907717,"PostDate":1447980669,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Vjohana and Congrats on your destination wedding coming up next year!!! You've come to the right place to find loads of answers to your planning questions and help from all the resources you find here - so well done on getting a great start!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and that you enjoy your wonderful journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....to inspire you along your way, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we've captured in our incomparable Mayan Riviera.....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>- taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/12248012_10153740893219487_2804814526822408303_o.jpg\" alt=\"12248012_10153740893219487_2804814526822\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/12109790_10153682859529487_4869403078968401747_o.jpg\" alt=\"12109790_10153682859529487_4869403078968\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11951533_10153610355409487_3502002007315431031_o.jpg\" alt=\"11951533_10153610355409487_3502002007315\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"148.0.37.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79751,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ce813f11868518cbc022b301f2e4558","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I recommend you this travel agency. They have a nice place for your wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Heaven Tours Group - heaventourstravelusa@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck !!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Maria&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907723,"PostDate":1447993557,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I recommend you this travel agency. They have a nice place for your wedding.<\/p>\n<p>Heaven Tours Group - heaventourstravelusa@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck !!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Maria<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heaventourstravelusa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"148.0.37.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447993202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maitte","Id":285390,"Name":"maitte","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79751","Title":"Wedding Packages And Additional Costs","LastPostDate":1447993557},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
