d like you&#039;re really ahead of the game!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1821526,"PostDate":1388672307,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats & happy planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> sound like you're really ahead of the game!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jareese425@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.177.5.32","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386980832,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jareese425","Id":275617,"Name":"jareese425","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.169.43.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c197fbe7c98aa0b201013936997ab8f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats!!!! I&#039;m new to this forum and i&#039;m still deciding where to have my destination wedding. Has anyone worked with destinationweddings.com? Does anyone prefer or should I just plan my destination wedding on my own? Please help!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- AprilRae&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869145,"PostDate":1409082036,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats!!!! I'm new to this forum and i'm still deciding where to have my destination wedding. Has anyone worked with destinationweddings.com? Does anyone prefer or should I just plan my destination wedding on my own? Please help!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- AprilRae<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aprilraec@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"172.8.146.161","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407389256,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279341.jpg?oh=f0e1ab09885b9a0c0901abfaf8de6a97&oe=54cbd23d&__gda__=1422573169_b7902439d71c7ac75b71b3d5542fbc56","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AprilRae","Id":279341,"Name":"AprilRae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.107.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a64204ecce3047cdd5f16787deb1b7b9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AprilRae\" post=\"1869145\" timestamp=\"1409082036\"]\nCongrats!!!! I&#039;m new to this forum and i&#039;m still deciding where to have my destination wedding. Has anyone worked with destinationweddings.com? Does anyone prefer or should I just plan my destination wedding on my own? Please help!!  :)\n\n- AprilRae[\/quote]I suggest you try and talk with a travel agent first. Maybe after you&#039;ve narrowed down the country\/area where you want to have it. I don&#039;t know if it has to be through destination weddings.com but I think travel agents can be very helpful in narrowing down hotels that have your \"musts\". \n\nTo narrow down the place I just searched online for how much trips are to a general area. We chose Mexico because,aside from Cuba, it seemed the most affordable and my fianc\u00e9 did not want to go to Cuba. We just thought we would have more people come if it was more affordable \n\nGood luck and happy planning! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1869189,"PostDate":1409091397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AprilRae, on 26 August 2014 - 11:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Congrats!!!! I'm new to this forum and i'm still deciding where to have my destination wedding. Has anyone worked with destinationweddings.com? Does anyone prefer or should I just plan my destination wedding on my own? Please help!!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\n- AprilRae<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI suggest you try and talk with a travel agent first. Maybe after you've narrowed down the country\/area where you want to have it. I don't know if it has to be through destination weddings.com but I think travel agents can be very helpful in narrowing down hotels that have your \"musts\". <br><br>\nTo narrow down the place I just searched online for how much trips are to a general area. We chose Mexico because,aside from Cuba, it seemed the most affordable and my fianc\u00e9 did not want to go to Cuba. We just thought we would have more people come if it was more affordable <br><br>\nGood luck and happy planning! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359763104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"74739","Title":"November 2015 Brides!!","LastPostDate":1447740596},"Pages":{"TotalItems":66,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
