a beautiful wedding venue, as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured there, with more at the album link here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152371453279487.1073741888.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Jade Wedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-lga.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10258352_10152371455369487_706874969640279556_o.jpg\" alt=\"10258352_10152371455369487_7068749696402\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10275443_10152371455799487_8993758335815448681_o.jpg\" alt=\"10275443_10152371455799487_8993758335815\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10255591_10152371456924487_4457875792888554925_o.jpg\" alt=\"10255591_10152371456924487_4457875792888\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879402,"PostDate":1417448372,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your NOW Jade wedding coming up next Nov, julianow, and welcome to our forum community!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You've chosen a beautiful wedding venue, as you can see in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured there, with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152371453279487.1073741888.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Jade Wedding<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-lga.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10258352_10152371455369487_706874969640279556_o.jpg\" alt=\"10258352_10152371455369487_7068749696402\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10275443_10152371455799487_8993758335815448681_o.jpg\" alt=\"10275443_10152371455799487_8993758335815\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10255591_10152371456924487_4457875792888554925_o.jpg\" alt=\"10255591_10152371456924487_4457875792888\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.254.81.181","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ac25f3f88a80ba62e3f56f46400e533","RawContent":"Congrats ladies!! I am getting married November 20,2015 at the Moon Palace! I&#039;m beyond excited. So far, we&#039;ve sent our STD&#039;s. Looking for my dress now.","Attachments":[],"Id":1880396,"PostDate":1418678515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats ladies!! I am getting married November 20,2015 at the Moon Palace! I'm beyond excited. So far, we've sent our STD's. Looking for my dress now.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"s.jackson_84@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.254.81.181","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418246080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/